sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Acknowledge durable intake before asynchronous storage
accDescr: The API acknowledges the pledge after SQS accepts it. Workers write idempotently and delete only after success, allowing safe retries.
participant User as Donor
participant API as Pledge API
participant Q as SQS queue
participant Worker
participant DB as DynamoDB
User->>API: Pledge with request ID
API->>Q: SendMessage
Q-->>API: Durably accepted
API-->>User: Pledge received
Worker->>Q: ReceiveMessage
Q-->>Worker: Pledge
Worker->>DB: Idempotent write by request ID
alt Write succeeds or already exists
 DB-->>Worker: Success
 Worker->>Q: DeleteMessage
else Transient write failure
 Note over Q,Worker: Message becomes visible again for retry
end
